Files: yolox/models/{yolox,yolo_head,yolo_pafpn,darknet,network_blocks,losses}.py and
yolox/utils/{boxes,ema}.py, flattened into this directory; augment_hsv and _mirror from
yolox/data/data_augment.py (in data_augment.py).

Changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
- yolo_head.py: imports from .boxes instead of yolox.utils; stdlib logging instead of loguru;
  meshgrid is torch.meshgrid(indexing="ij") (what yolox.utils.compat does on torch >= 1.10);
  visualize_assign_result removed (needs yolox.utils.visualize).
- yolox.py: visualize() removed (it calls visualize_assign_result).
- data_augment.py: only augment_hsv and _mirror kept (the rest of the module, and its
  yolox.utils import, dropped); functions unchanged.
- __init__.py added (model names load lazily, so data_augment imports without torch).
  No other code changes.
